    "details": {
      "alignment": "Lawful Good",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": "human"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Princess Daisy.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 4 → CR 2 as a noble. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Competent Royal</strong> — Sarasaland / Mushroom Regency Coalition</p><p>Status: Active, respected, probably exhausted</p><p>Princess Daisy is the ruler of Sarasaland and the person who hosted the Second Diplomatic Summit. She is also, in Waluigi's considered opinion, one of the only royals in the region who actually knows what she's doing. While everyone else was walking out or giving ego-speeches or getting framed for corruption, Daisy managed the chaos, enforced limits, and kept the relief program on track. Waluigi has enormous respect for Daisy because she does the WORK while others take the credit or create the problems. Also, she's one of the few royals who has ever acknowledged Waluigi's existence at social events, which Waluigi appreciates more than he will admit publicly.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Host of the Summit</strong> — “Princess Daisy is the ruler of Sarasaland and the person who hosted the Second Diplomatic Summit.”</li><li><strong>No Committees</strong> — “She maintains alliances, manages resources, and makes decisions without needing to form twelve committees first.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/princess_daisy</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/princess_daisy</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
